{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Turning Manor is a first person spot the difference anomaly memory game in the psychological horror genre. <br><br>Welcome to Turning Manor! Your new job as Quality Control Inspector is simple:\u00a0</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Count the glitches</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Choose the correct door</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But this won't be as easy as it seems...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3855530/extras/e9dc2e8bbedbd67286dcbbb0427dbecc.poster.avif?t=1767837039\" width=1170 height=490 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3855530/extras/e9dc2e8bbedbd67286dcbbb0427dbecc.webm?t=1767837039\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3855530/extras/e9dc2e8bbedbd67286dcbbb0427dbecc.mp4?t=1767837039\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unlock unique areas</strong>. Each with distinct layouts, dangers and challenges.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Approachable yet challenging</strong>. Beginner friendly as perfect accuracy is not needed to progress. Yet still challenging for experts as glitches get more difficult and a good grade requires good accuracy.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mystery to unravel</strong>. Find and collect items for clues to uncover more about the Manor's inhabitants. Discover the answer to question: what is going on at Turning Manor?</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Developer Note</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No part of this game knowingly uses AI generated content or images. Though m